{"unit_id":"yuunnn__dsh-on-imessage#card-zh","repo":"yuunnn/dsh-on-imessage","commit":"81b99763bf17f6b88a827e173353c487247cb6d9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-on-iMessage 是一款面向 macOS 与 iPhone 的 DSH iMessage 集成插件。它在 DSH profile 启动时运行本机桥接程序，通过 Messages 收取获准联系人的消息，并把 DSH 回复发回 iMessage。用户可以查看工作区和会话、切换工作区或指定会话、开启新会话，也能直接继续当前会话；若本机 DSH Web 可用则同步到 Web 会话，否则调用 headless CLI。适合希望从 iPhone 延续本机 DSH 工作的人。需要配置收发双方标识和桥接账号，并在 Mac 上登录 Messages、安装 Python 与 DSH。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:7-22","bridge.py:772-812","bridge.py:479-509"]}
{"unit_id":"yuunnn__dsh-on-imessage#card-en","repo":"yuunnn/dsh-on-imessage","commit":"81b99763bf17f6b88a827e173353c487247cb6d9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-on-iMessage connects local DSH sessions to iPhone Messages. A DSH profile starts a bridge that forwards messages and replies. Commands list or switch workspaces and sessions, or start a session; regular texts continue it. Uses the local Web API or CLI. Requires macOS Messages, Python, and DSH.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:7-22","bridge.py:772-812","bridge.py:479-509"]}
